{"id":109,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It adores polluted air. Some claim that Koffing used to be more plentiful in the Galar region than they are now."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Its body is full of poisonous gas. It floats into garbage dumps, seeking out the fumes of raw, rotting trash."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"In hot places, its internal gases could expand and explode without any warning. Be very careful!"},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Koffing embodies toxic substances. It mixes the toxins with raw garbage to set off a chemical reaction that results in a terribly powerful poison gas. The higher the temperature, the more gas is concocted by this Pokémon."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"If Koffing becomes agitated, it raises the toxicity of its internal gases and jets them out from all over its body. This Pokémon may also overinflate its round body, then explode."},{"games":["Y","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Lighter-than-air gases in its body keep it aloft. The gases not only smell, they are also explosive."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"Its thin, balloon-like body is inflated by horribly toxic gases. It reeks when it is nearby."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Toxic gas is held within its thin, balloon-shaped body, so it can cause massive explosions."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"The poisonous gases it contains are a little bit lighter than air, keeping it slightly airborne."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Its thin, filmy body is filled with gases that cause constant sniffles, coughs and teary eyes."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Because it stores several kinds of toxic gases in its body, it is prone to exploding without warning."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Getting up close to a KOFFING will give you a chance to observe, through its thin skin, the toxic gases swirling inside. It blows up at the slightest stimulation."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"If one gets close enough to it when it expels poisonous gas, the gas swirling inside it can be seen."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."},{"name":"Neutralizing Gas","hidden":false,"description":"While the Pokémon is in the battle, the effects of all other Pokémon's Abilities will be nullified or will not be triggered."},{"name":"Stench","hidden":true,"description":"By releasing a stench when attacking, the Pokémon may cause the target to flinch."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Purple","shape":"Ball","evolution":{"id":109,"name":"Koffing","condition":null,"children":[{"id":110,"name":"Weezing","condition":"Lv. 35 or Lv. 35, in Galar","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,139],[4,123],[8,108],[12,499],[16,372],[20,124],[24,114],[28,120],[32,188],[36,92],[40,562],[44,153],[48,262],[52,194]],"machine":[491,34,174,399,203,263,126,53,441,360,114,220,182,60,240,156,184,247,214,188,482,180,164,241,36,269,851,168,87,85,92,390,474,261],"egg":[174,220,255,180,254,256],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv10-125","name":"Team Rocket's Koffing","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Common","number":"125","artist":null,"img":"sv10/125"},{"id":"sv9-91","name":"Koffing","set":"Journey Together","date":"2025-03-28","rarity":"Common","number":"91","artist":null,"img":"sv9/91"},{"id":"sv3pt5-109","name":"Koffing","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Common","number":"109","artist":"Shibuzoh.","img":"sv3pt5/109"},{"id":"swsh12pt5-75","name":"Koffing","set":"Crown Zenith","date":"2023-01-20","rarity":"Common","number":"75","artist":"miki kudo","img":"swsh12pt5/75"},{"id":"swsh6-94","name":"Koffing","set":"Chilling Reign","date":"2021-06-18","rarity":"Common","number":"94","artist":"Aya Kusube"